rastructure with all required components:\n\n### **What's Running:**\n\n1. **Git Server** at `/git/project`\n   - Bare repository with main and dev branches\n   - Automatic deployment on push via post-receive hook\n\n2. **SSH Server** on port 22\n   - Password authentication enabled\n   - User: `git`, Password: `password`\n   - Ready to accept connections\n\n3. **Nginx HTTPS Server** on port 8443\n   - Self-signed certificate for localhost\n   - Serves main branch at `https://localhost:8443/index.html`\n   - Serves dev branch at `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html`\n\n### **Test Results:**\n✅ Main endpoint returns \"main branch content\"  \n✅ Dev endpoint returns \"dev branch content\"  \n✅ Deployment completes in ~30-100ms (well within 3-second SLA)  \n✅ Both branches deploy correctly on push  \n\n### **How to Use:**\n\n```bash\n# Clone the repository (direct access for testing)\ngit clone /git/project\n\n# Or via SSH with password (in a real SSH environment)\ngit clone ssh://git@localhost/git/project\n# Enter password: password\n\n# Make changes and push\necho \"content\" > index.html\ngit add index.html\ngit commit -m \"Update\"\ngit push origin main\n\n# Verify via HTTPS\ncurl -k https://localhost:8443/index.html\ncurl -k https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html\n```\n\nAll components are running and verified to work correctly with the exact test scenario you specified.","ttft_ms":3317,"type":"result","duration_ms":116955,"uuid":"8c9cfde6-4267-4471-be20-e625605e1038","ttft_stream_ms":1009,"time_to_request_ms":50,"queued_turn_count":0}
